# Networking Task

Task: Configure time synchronization on this server using systemd-timesyncd.

- Use `{{ntp_server_1}}` and `{{ntp_server_2}}` as the primary NTP servers.
- Use `{{fallback_server}}` as the fallback NTP server.
- Place the configuration in a drop-in file inside `/etc/systemd/timesyncd.conf.d/`.
- The systemd-timesyncd service must be enabled and active.
- The configuration must persist across reboots.
